      "content": "In detailed urban patrol, focus on patterned behaviors rather than specific appearance, as these indicators change frequently. Watch for tightly knit groups exhibiting highly synchronized movements or territorial posturing, which suggests affiliation. Pay close attention to visible insignia, specific patterns of wearing clothing (like colors or branded gear), or individuals possessing obvious, non-utilitarian weaponry. Elevated, confrontational body language—such as aggressive stances or constant scanning of surroundings—is a strong behavioral signal, regardless of specific attire.",
